## 🎯 사용 예제

### HeroCard.free (실제 예제)

```
component HeroCard {
  props { title: string }

  @animation cardEnter {
    duration: 600
    opacity: 0 → 1
    transform: translateY(20px) → translateY(0px)
  }

  @glass {
    background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08)
    backdropFilter: blur(12px)
    border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.15)
  }

  @3d {
    perspective: 1200px
    rotateX: 2deg
    rotateY: -5deg
  }

  @micro {
    selector: .button
    event: hover
    action: pulse
    duration: 500
  }

  @scroll {
    selector: .content
    animation: cardEnter
    offset: -100px
  }

  markup {
    <div class="hero-card glass-0 transform-3d-0">
      <h1>{title}</h1>
      <button class="button">Click me</button>
      <div class="content">Content</div>
    </div>
  }
}
```

