## 🔧 Phase 11.3: Query Builder (COMPLETE - FreeLang)

### Core Components

#### Enums (Type-safe operations)
- `QueryType`: SELECT, INSERT, UPDATE, DELETE
- `ComparisonOp`: EQ, NEQ, GT, GTE, LT, LTE, LIKE, IN, BETWEEN
