|-----------|------|-------|
| Cache hit (get) | <0.1ms | Array lookup |
| Cache set | <0.5ms | Append + access count |
| LRU eviction | <2ms | Linear scan for min |
| Pattern invalidation | <10ms | String matching |
| Cleanup | <5ms | Expired entry scan |

